Package: nubo-theme
Architecture: all
Depends: gnome-themes-extra,
         gtk2-engines-murrine,
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: Nubo OS application, shell and login screen theme
 Monochrome theme for applications, the GNOME Shell, libadwaita apps and the
 login screen. Built from the Colloid GTK theme (grey variant, black tweak).

Package: nubo-icons
Architecture: all
Depends: hicolor-icon-theme,
         papirus-icon-theme,
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: Nubo OS icon theme
 A thin layer over the Papirus icon theme: grey folders and the Nubo mark in
 place of distributor logos. All other icons come from Papirus and update
 with it.

Package: nubo-sounds
Architecture: all
Depends: ocean-sound-theme,
         sound-theme-freedesktop,
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: Nubo OS system sounds
 Sound theme for Nubo OS. Currently maps onto the Ocean sound theme.

Package: nubo-glass
Architecture: all
Depends: gnome-shell (>= 46),
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: Nubo OS glass effect for the desktop shell
 Frosted-glass blur for the top bar, dock, overview and lock screen.
 Ships the Blur my Shell extension system-wide.

Package: nubo-installer
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Nubo OS installer appearance
 Configuration, illustrations and slides that give the Ubuntu Desktop
 installer the Nubo OS look. Only used on installation media.

Package: nubo-account
Architecture: all
Depends: authd,
         curl,
         gir1.2-adw-1,
         gir1.2-gtk-4.0,
         libsecret-tools,
         librsvg2-bin,
         python3-gi,
         snapd,
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: Sign in to Nubo OS with a Nubo account
 Connects the login screen to Nubo SSO. Sets itself up on the first boot
 with a network connection.

Package: nubo-search
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libopengl0, libgl1, libegl1, libglx0, libgbm1, libdrm2, libfontconfig1,
         libfreetype6, libdbus-1-3, libx11-6, libxcb1, libwayland-client0, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Nubo Search, the launcher opened with Super+Space
 A fast launcher for apps, files, calculations and clipboard history, built
 from Vicinae. Starts with the session and opens on Super+Space. Carries its
 own libraries.

Package: nubo-branding
Architecture: all
Depends: plymouth,
         plymouth-theme-ubuntu-text,
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: Nubo OS logos, wallpapers, boot screen and desktop defaults
 Logo files, default wallpapers, the boot screen, the system identity,
 first-run defaults and the one-time cleanup after installation.

